fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstvecdeque.html#gst_vec_deque_push_tail_struct","fragment":"\n\tgst_vec_deque_push_tail_struct\n\nPushes the element at address p_struct to the tail of the queue array\n(Copies the contents of a structure of the struct_size specified when\ncreating the queue into the array).\nParameters:\na GstVecDeque object\naddress of element or structure to push to the tail of the queue\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});